            "line": 652,
            "text": "theorem block_expansion (b : CorrectionState.HarmonicBlock Point) (J : Finset ℤ)\n    (n : ℕ) (i : Fin 3) (hs : (b.velocity n i).support ⊆ J) (x : Cylinder) :\n    b.oscillation n x i = ∑ j ∈ J,\n      ((b.velocity n i j x.1) * PhysicalGraphBounds.character 1 (fullPhase b j n x)).re"
